extends ../../base-email

block content
  tr
    td(style="padding: 40px 40px 32px;")
      // Main Heading
      h1(style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 44px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Organise memorable hackathons with Pacepard
      
      // Greeting and Intro
      p(style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Hello 
        span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;")= name
        | ! Welcome to the #1 platform for organising unforgettable hackathons and collaborative events.
      
      // Primary CTA Button
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 40px;")
        tr
          td
            a(href=loginLink || "#" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; background-color: #1A73E8; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Get started
      
      // Illustrative Section Placeholder
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 48px; width: 100%; background-color: #F8F9FA; border-radius: 8px;")
        tr
          td(style="padding: 40px; text-align: center;")
            div(style="font-size: 48px; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 16px;") 🚀
            p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
              | Plan, execute, and celebrate successful hackathons with our powerful collaboration platform
      
      // 3 Ways to Get Started Section
      h2(style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") 3 ways to get started
      
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 40px; width: 100%;")
        tr
          td(style="padding: 0 0 32px; vertical-align: top;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;")
              tr
                td(style="width: 32px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 4px;")
                  div(style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #E8F0FE; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;")
                    span(style="font-size: 14px;") 📋
                td(style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 12px;")
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
                    a(href=templateLink || "#" style="color: #1A73E8; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;") Use a template
                    |  from our template library to get a jumpstart on your hackathon project.
        tr
          td(style="padding: 0 0 32px; vertical-align: top;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;")
              tr
                td(style="width: 32px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 4px;")
                  div(style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #E8F0FE; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;")
                    span(style="font-size: 14px;") 👥
                td(style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 12px;")
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
                    a(href=inviteLink || "#" style="color: #1A73E8; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;") Invite your team members
                    |  to get the most out of Pacepard and collaborate effectively.
        tr
          td(style="padding: 0; vertical-align: top;")
            table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;")
              tr
                td(style="width: 32px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 4px;")
                  div(style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #E8F0FE; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;")
                    span(style="font-size: 14px;") 🎓
                td(style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 12px;")
                  p(style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
                    a(href=guideLink || "#" style="color: #1A73E8; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;") Discover best practices
                    |  through our in-product guide and learn how to organise successful events.
      
      // Closing
      p(style="margin: 40px 0 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Thanks,
        br
        span(style="font-weight: 500;") The Pacepard Team
